WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.477
Salom!

2
00:00:00.477 --> 00:00:06.438
Bugun shunday tenglamalarni ko‘ramizki, ularda hosila oshkor ifodalanmagan.

3
00:00:06.438 --> 00:00:09.617
Masalan, y shtrix kvadrati to‘rtga teng.

4
00:00:09.617 --> 00:00:15.578
Bunday tenglamada bitta nuqtadan bir nechta integral chiziq o‘tishi mumkin.

5
00:00:15.578 --> 00:00:22.334
Dars oxirida siz ikki usulni bilasiz: hosilaga nisbatan yechish va parametr kiritish.

6
00:00:22.584 --> 00:00:24.821
Hosilani p harfi bilan belgilaymiz.

7
00:00:24.821 --> 00:00:29.358
Tenglama F ning x, y, p dan funksiyasi nolga teng ko‘rinishida bo‘ladi.

8
00:00:29.358 --> 00:00:34.663
Agar F p ga nisbatan ko‘phad bo‘lsa, uning darajasi tenglamaning darajasi deyiladi.

9
00:00:34.663 --> 00:00:40.670
Har bir nuqtada p ning bir nechta ildizi bo‘lsa, har bir ildiz o‘z integral chizig‘ini beradi.

10
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:48.109
Misol: y shtrix kvadrat minus x qo‘shuv y ko‘paytirilgan y shtrix, qo‘shuv x y, nolga teng.

11
00:00:48.109 --> 00:00:54.903
Bu p ga nisbatan kvadrat uchhad va u p minus x bilan p minus y ko‘paytmasiga ajraladi.

12
00:00:54.903 --> 00:01:01.934
Demak, tenglama ikkita oddiy tenglamaga bo‘linadi: y shtrix teng x, yoki y shtrix teng y.

13
00:01:02.184 --> 00:01:06.599
Birinchisidan y teng x kvadratning yarmi qo‘shuv C.

14
00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:10.840
Ikkinchisidan y teng C ko‘paytirilgan e daraja x.

15
00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:14.909
Umumiy integral — bu ikki oilaning birlashmasi.

16
00:01:14.909 --> 00:01:22.526
Tekshiring: birinchi oilada p teng x, ikkinchisida p teng y, demak ko‘paytma nolga teng.

17
00:01:22.776 --> 00:01:28.731
Agar tenglamani hosilaga nisbatan yechish qiyin bo‘lsa, p ni parametr deb olamiz.

18
00:01:28.731 --> 00:01:31.084
Masalan, x teng p kub qo‘shuv p.

19
00:01:31.084 --> 00:01:35.569
Unda dx teng uch p kvadrat qo‘shuv bir, dp ga ko‘paytirilgan.

20
00:01:35.569 --> 00:01:38.142
dy esa p ko‘paytirilgan dx ga teng.

21
00:01:38.142 --> 00:01:45.494
Integrallasak, y teng to‘rtdan uch p ning to‘rtinchi darajasi qo‘shuv p kvadratning yarmi qo‘shuv C.

22
00:01:45.744 --> 00:01:48.082
Javob parametrik ko‘rinishda.

23
00:01:48.082 --> 00:01:54.532
Tekshirish: dy ni dp bo‘yicha dx ning dp bo‘yicha hosilasiga bo‘lsak, p chiqadi.

24
00:01:54.532 --> 00:01:57.354
Demak y shtrix haqiqatan p ga teng.

25
00:01:57.354 --> 00:02:02.030
Esda tuting: asosiy formula — dy teng p dx, aksincha emas.

26
00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:10.638
Grafikda y teng x kvadratning yarmi oilasidan uchta egri chiziq va y teng C e daraja x oilasidan ikkita egri chiziq ko‘rsatilgan.

27
00:02:10.638 --> 00:02:16.598
Ular y teng x to‘g‘ri chizig‘ida bir-biriga urinadi: u yerda ikkala ildiz ustma-ust tushadi.

28
00:02:16.848 --> 00:02:19.351
Endi o‘zingizni tekshiring.

29
00:02:19.351 --> 00:02:22.502
Savolni o‘qing va javobni tanlang.
